WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.742
Staff can now find any member, by name, by email, or by their standing in the

00:00:06.742 --> 00:00:07.658
community.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.385
The Members page lists everyone, newest first. Each row shows name and email, home

00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:17.559
church, the day they joined in Toronto, events, and status.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.089
Active, Flagged and Suspended are tabs. Each is a link, so the address names what is

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:23.995
on screen.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.133
Search waits for the last key, then asks once. It looks in names and emails, never

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.497
in a home church.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.668
When nobody matches, the page says so, and Clear search brings everyone back.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.921
Twenty-five members fill a page. The pages keep the tab and the search, and a new

00:00:48.921 --> 00:00:51.044
page moves focus to the table.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.580
While members load, rows hold their place. If they do not load, Try again asks

00:00:58.580 --> 00:00:59.232
again.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.554
On the server, one answer holds the page, the matches, and the size of the

00:01:06.554 --> 00:01:09.993
community. Nothing staff search for is ever logged.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.912
Later, staff flag, suspend and reinstate.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.717
That's slice twenty-six point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for

00:01:28.717 --> 00:01:30.570
health in body and spirit.
